10. What are Window Functions?
Answer
Window functions calculate across related rows without collapsing the result set.
 
SELECT Name,
 
       Salary,
 
       ROW_NUMBER() OVER
 
       (ORDER BY Salary DESC)
 
FROM Employee;
 
Common functions:
 
ROW_NUMBER()
 
RANK()
 
DENSE_RANK()
 
LAG()
 
